{
 "file": "EN/EVENT_DATA/MESSAGE/E400/E451_003.BMD",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "MSG_000_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Igor",
   "en": "I believe I ordered his execution.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_001_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Caroline",
   "en": "......",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_002_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Justine",
   "en": "......",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_004_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Caroline",
   "en": "Master... Have you forsaken humanity?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_007_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Justine",
   "en": "We are wardens—those who rehabilitate[n]prisoners.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_008_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Igor",
   "en": "What?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_008_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Justine",
   "en": "Something speaks to me in my mind.[n]Our true duty is not to kill...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_030_0_5#0",
   "speaker": "Mysterious Voice",
   "en": "Help...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_030_1_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "......!?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_030_1_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I can hear someone's voice...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_030_1_5#0",
   "speaker": "Mysterious Voice",
   "en": "Please... help...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_030_2_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "This voice...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_030_2_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I feel like I've heard it somewhere[n]before...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_030_3_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Who are you?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_030_3_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "What should I do?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_030_3_5#0",
   "speaker": "Mysterious Voice",
   "en": "Who...?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_030_3_5#1",
   "speaker": "Mysterious Voice",
   "en": "Yes, we are those who wish for true[n]rehabilitation...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_030_4_0#0",
   "speaker": "Mysterious Voice",
   "en": "What should you do?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_030_4_0#1",
   "speaker": "Mysterious Voice",
   "en": "Our desire is for you to complete your[n]true rehabilitation...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_030_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Justine",
   "en": "We are not executioners.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_030_5_0#1",
   "speaker": "Justine",
   "en": "That is the truth we had forgotten.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_030_7_0#0",
   "speaker": "Caroline",
   "en": "We've decided... We will not forsake[n]humanity!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_032_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Caroline",
   "en": "Your right eye, and my left...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_032_5_0#1",
   "speaker": "Caroline",
   "en": "It's as if they're the same... yet mirrored...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_033_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Mysterious Voice",
   "en": "Ah, now is the time for our wish to be[n]realized...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_034_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Caroline",
   "en": "I finally remember...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_034_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Caroline",
   "en": "...How we were torn \"apart.\"",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_035_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "You remember?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_035_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Torn apart?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_036_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Justine",
   "en": "We were originally one...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_036_3_0#0",
   "speaker": "Justine",
   "en": "Yet we were torn asunder into halves...[n]by malevolent intent!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_036_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Igor",
   "en": "*chuckle*",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_037_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Caroline",
   "en": "So we were captives, same as you...[n]Heh... To think we'd learn that truth[n]from a prisoner.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_040_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Justine",
   "en": "Let us reclaim our true form!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_041_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Caroline",
   "en": "Hey, we'll give you your last job.[n]Be thankful and obey!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_042_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Justine",
   "en": "You must fuse us together, with your[n]own hands.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_043_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Fuse?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_043_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "That'll turn you back?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_046_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Caroline",
   "en": "It's time you returned the favor for us[n]assisting with your growth. Do it with[n]care!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_047_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Caroline & Justine",
   "en": "Now, fuse us!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_048_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Caroline & Justine",
   "en": "Now, fuse us!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_049_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "All right.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_049_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Time to save you.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  }
 ]
}